        <p>RUNCORN UNION BOARD OF GUARDIANS.</p>
        <p>The ordinary meeting of this Board was held at the Union Workhouse, Dutton, on Tuesday after- noon. There were present :—Messrs. Heywood (presiding), Brandreth, Lewis, Williams, Stokes, Baguley, Aaron, Baxter, Taylor, and Nor- man, and the Rev. J. W. N. Tanner, and Mr. Ashton (clerk).</p>
